Subject: [PATCH 8/9] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...cessors.swift => Sample.Batch where Element is Copyable.swift} | 0
 ...t => Sample.Batch where Element is Swift is is Sendable.swift} | 0
 2 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Sample/{Sample.Batch+accessors.swift => Sample.Batch where Element is Copyable.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Sample/{Sample.Batch+Swift.Sendable.swift => Sample.Batch where Element is Swift is is Sendable.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch+accessors.swift b/Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch where Element is Copyable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch+accessors.swift
rename to Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch where Element is Copyable.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch+Swift.Sendable.swift b/Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch where Element is Swift is is Sendable.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch+Swift.Sendable.swift
rename to Sources/Sample/Sample.Batch where Element is Swift is is Sendable.swift
